  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Worker MCP 是函数模块",
      "items": [
        "mcp_worker.py 的 _inventory / _procurement / _journal / _eschematic 工厂返回对应实例；它不是一个 Worker 类。",
        "lab_analyze_bom → ESchematicBridge.normalize_and_resolve_bom → InventoryStore.check_bom_shortage。",
        "lab_journal_capture_chat → InventoryStore.record_worklog + ForgeJournalStore 队列。",
        "底排三个类由 Worker MCP 分别调用；不虚构它们之间的继承或依赖。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "UI 到代码的定位",
      "items": [
        "app.js 的 renderForgePreviewHtml / renderForgeDashboard / renderForgeFullView 负责专用视图。",
        "app.js selectItem → server.py /items/{id} → ForgeAdapter.get_item；文件预览走 /doc。",
        "server.py create_observatory_app 持有 AdapterRegistry；get_fleet_workspaces 汇总只读条目。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "图的范围",
      "items": [
        "仅列选定的真实类、关键方法和引用关系；函数入口保留在说明卡中。",
        "来源链接固定到当前 HEAD；未把独立 labbot-commerce 前端声明为已检查代码。"
      ]
    }
